# Pins for the openai_chat scenario's own venv (.venv-openai-v2), maintainers only.
# opentelemetry-instrumentation-openai-v2 2.4b0 imports opentelemetry.util.genai.instruments,
# which util-genai 1.2b0 removed, while every other util-genai instrumentation in
# requirements.in needs util-genai>=1.2b0 -- so openai-v2 cannot share the main lock.
# Regenerate requirements-openai-v2.txt, with hashes for every transitive package, via ./lock.sh.
